Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dragon Balls.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When seven of these\Nmysterious balls are gathered{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and the password recited,\Na dragon called Shenron appears.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shenron will grant\Nwhatever wish is requested.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This man, Son Goku, may appear gentle,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but is the most powerful warrior\Nwho possesses unworldly strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He lived in the mountains as a child,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}searched for the Dragon Balls,\Nmet many friends,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and went on adventures with them\Nas he grew into adulthood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:01:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One day, a vicious battle race\Ncalled Saiyans arrived.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Goku learned that he, too, was a Saiyan{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}who was sent to Earth as an infant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Saiyans maintain a youthful body\Nfor much of their lives.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Goku continues to face terrifying enemies\Nand grows through his battles.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And together, with his former rivals,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.13,0:01:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}he continues to protect Earth from evil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:48.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.27,0:02:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:22.91,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,DEGESU
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we go save Dende first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or do we fight the Tamagami\Nand get the last Dragon Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dende comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Let's go rescue Dende-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The gates are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's force them open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Force Captain! Kadem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GENDARMERIE FORCE CAPTAIN\NKADEM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Force Member Number Two. Danima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GENDARMERIE FORCE MEMBER NO. 2\NDANIMA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Force Member Number Three! Hillia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GENDARMERIE FORCE MEMBER NO.3\NHILLIA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Force Member Number Four! Mashim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GENDARMERIE FORCE MEMBER NO.4\NMASHIM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Force Member Number Five! Gaimoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GENDARMERIE FORCE MEMBER NO.5\NGAIMOI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The five of us make the Gendarmerie Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little brats! The Gendarmerie Force\Nwon't let you take another step further!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've never heard of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then listen closely before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-I am…\N-Save it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Vegeta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?! You want a piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain! This brat's acting up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-Maybe, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,these guys actually did defeat Majin Buu\Nand the other Tamagamis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it's finally my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it! In that case,\Nit's time to use that attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The next one will be even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yowch ouch ouch ouch ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It still stings a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well. I'll forgive you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the best potato chips.\NHere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Gomah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gomah…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, which way was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Gendarmerie Force was defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought the item\Nthat Degesu-sama asked for, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh come on! Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is too much of a hassle!\NWho cares about this thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I…I better deliver this,\Nget my money, and go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh. There's another wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we move in a group like this,\Nwon't we stand out too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, we'll go ahead and save Dende.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is it, Goku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop eating and focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sense Dende's ki nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let Dende go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed you made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done. I commend your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Degesu! Stop this foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:13:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well, if it isn't\Nmy distinguished older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been centuries… No, over a millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I get it!\NYou're Supreme Kai-sama's little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, my friends, don't get any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Degesu, what is it you're trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trying to do? Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I want to be\Nking of the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What could a Glind possibly do\Nas king of the Demon Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've always been ambitious\Nand overly self-confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your lack of thought\Nis obvious from your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop acting like you know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in a Glind's nature\Nto seek higher positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what has your so very thoughtful self\Nbeen doing in the outside world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it,\Nwhat do you do, Supreme Kai-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I oversee peace and order in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is Degesu doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He must have some kind of plan…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait… But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be…!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he planning to abandon me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The little girl from\Nthe Third Demon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You and your little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice goin', Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My head's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saved us! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's eerily cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Serves you right, Degesu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the time to celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?! What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Degesu-sama asked me\Nto bring this belt for him, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The belt! Oh! It's the belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. I haven't been paid\Nfor my services yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I even lost the hat my ex gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, fine. Take whatever you like\Nfrom the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really it!\NIt's really the real Third Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, we've rescued Dende, all that's left\Nis to turn us back into adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about Gomah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna take care of him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Gomah can't be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fighting the Tamagami\Nand becoming adults first will be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The First Demon World Tamagami\Nis in the square right over there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! This Tamagami looks even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, who's fighting this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I let you have the last one,\Nso I'm goin' next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Ball's missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right! What's goin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Ball has gone to the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's…!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Majin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately the First Demon World\NDragon Ball is already ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How does it come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This doesn't work either!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You stupid thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid…!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray! It's the Third Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Wh-What? You said\NI could take whatever I liked!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold this Eye and place it\Nagainst the middle of my forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gross! No way! No way ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Supreme Demon King is asking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care who asks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! I'll pay you 50,000 dokuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make it 100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, very well! Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.71,0:23:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.05,0:23:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.19,0:23:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:36.45,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,GOMAH
